{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The loopler is an idle-like roguelite simulation game about maximizing and augmenting your runs to go to infinity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>UPGRADES</strong></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/37a4daa7cd452c80512ed592aef759f3.poster.avif?t=1768597705\" width=766 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/37a4daa7cd452c80512ed592aef759f3.webm?t=1768597705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>   </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With a heap of different upgrades to create synergies and to keep your run alive,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> pick upgrades, discover synergies, and put together a build\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>GATES</strong></u> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/574081ee6329cde8950936db1de5484d.poster.avif?t=1768597705\" width=676 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/574081ee6329cde8950936db1de5484d.webm?t=1768597705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Place gates on the track to enable even more synergies and to enchance the craziness that will unfold<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/b561ad828be2ba7a1312b610d9f1061e.poster.avif?t=1768597705\" width=642 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/b561ad828be2ba7a1312b610d9f1061e.webm?t=1768597705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The goal for consecutive round increases after each round completed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assemble the god run and see if you can reach infinity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/509fc2b2383899d93d68a814c7752945.poster.avif?t=1768597705\" width=516 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4150860/extras/509fc2b2383899d93d68a814c7752945.webm?t=1768597705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>CONTENT</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">4+ Cars, each with their own advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">5+ Tracks with different looks and layouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">5 difficulty modes to make it even harder to go infinite</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">30+ Upgrades to get</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">14+ Gates to place</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">20+ Charms</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/